  "question": {
    "text": "<p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"color:black\">A ray of light is incident normally on one of the faces of a prism of apex angle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>°</mo></math>and refractive index&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>.</span><span>&nbsp;The angle of deviation of the ray is</span></p>\r"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<div><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math>  <mrow>   <mn>30</mn><mo>&deg;</mo>  </mrow> </math>  </span></p></div>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<div><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math>  <mrow>   <mn>45</mn><mo>&deg;</mo>  </mrow> </math>  </span></p></div>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<div><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mn>15</mn><mo>°</mo> </mrow> </math> </span></p></div>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "none of these",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><span>Using Snell&rsquo;s law for the refraction at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AC</mi></math>, we get</span></p><p><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#956;</mi><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mi>sini</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mi>sinr</mi></math> </span></p><p><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>sinr</mi></math> </span></p><p><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sinr</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></math> </span></p><p><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> </span></p><p><span style=\"position:relative;top:0.0pt\">&nbsp;<math> <mo>&#8756;</mo> </math> </span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Angle of deviation &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>45</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> </span></p><p align=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0022_a7d70f935bb1.jpeg\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 177px;\" /></p>"
  }
}